          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "powder",
            "zh": "粉末"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and water balloons at each other. They laugh, play, and "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Long ago, colours were made from flowers and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "spices",
            "zh": "香料"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Now, people also use "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "safe",
            "zh": "安全的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " coloured powders from "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "stores",
            "ref": "v-store"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Holi is fun for families and friends. Some places light "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "bonfires",
            "zh": "篝火"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the night before. Children and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
